  "question": "设函数 $y = f(x) (-\\infty < x < +\\infty)$ 的图形关于点 $A(a, y_1)$ 和点 $B(b, y_2) (a < b)$ 对称，试讨论函数 $f(x)$ 的周期性.",
  "answer": "$2(b-a)$",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "周期延拓",
    "奇偶延拓"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 由函数图形的对称性可知 $f(a + x) + f(a - x) = 2y_{1}, f(b + x) + f(b - x) = 2y_{2}$ ，只需讨论是否存在常数 $T \\neq 0$ ，使得 $\\forall x \\in \\mathbb{R}$ ，有 $f(x) = f(x + T)$ ."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "由于函数 $y = f(x)$ 的图形关于点 $A(a, y_1)$ 和点 $B(b, y_2)$ 对称，则"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "f (a + x) + f (a - x) = 2 y _ {1}, \\quad f (b + x) + f (b - x) = 2 y _ {2},"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "于是"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "\\begin{array}{r l} f (x) & = f [ a + (x - a) ] = 2 y _ {1} - f [ a - (x - a) ] \\\\ & = 2 y _ {1} - f (2 a - x) = 2 y _ {1} - f [ b + (2 a - x - b) ] \\\\ & = 2 y _ {1} - 2 y _ {2} + f [ b - (2 a - x - b) ] \\\\ & = 2 (y _ {1} - y _ {2}) + f [ x + 2 (b - a) ]. \\end{array}\\tag{①}"
      },
      {
        "id": "s6",
        "text": "由此可知，当 $y_{1}=y_{2}$ 时， $f(x)$ 是周期函数，其周期为 $2(b-a)$ ."
      },
      {
        "id": "s7",
        "text": "当 $y_{1} \\neq y_{2}$ 时，记 $f(x) = px + q + \\varphi(x)$ ， $p$ 和 $q$ 为常数，由①式得"
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "$2(b-a)$",
    "techniques_used": [
      "周期延拓",
      "奇偶延拓"
    ]
  },
